Switch statement

➢The switch statement is used to test for the equality against a

   set of known values.

➢The syntax for switch statement is:
   switch &lt;switch_expression&gt;
   case &lt;case_expression&gt;
        &lt;statements&gt;
   case &lt;case_expression&gt;
         &lt;statements&gt;
   …………………………………….
   otherwise
         &lt;statements&gt;
   end

